DECISIONS 195, EVALUATION.md §3.3: a finite chain of field defaults 3000000 deep, well within the
step budget, is still E4402 at 10000 frames; the same chain 100 deep evaluates.
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

/// A node.
record Node {
  /// Its depth.
  depth: Int = 3000000
  /// Its child, one shallower.
  child: Node? = if depth > 0 { { depth: depth - 1 } } else { none }
}

/// The deep chain.
let deep: Node = {}

/// The shallow chain.
let shallow: Node = { depth: 100 }
